# TURNIP TRUCK: Blipton as written. 32 x 32 cells that wrap both ways;
# 33 named places, each on a road beside a building and reachable from the
# depot and back; 12 crates, 4 canister stacks, 10 crossing pipes and 9 drop
# zones, one never far from the brine; the edges join (the Gloop Diner on
# the top row is a short drive from the Pickle Works gate near the bottom).
game turnip
wait 5
expect map_rows_ok == 1
expect map_dests == 33
expect map_dests_ok == 1
expect map_wrap_ok == 1
expect map_crates == 12
expect map_cans == 4
expect map_pipes == 10
expect map_drops == 9
expect map_drops_ok <= 260
expect path_max <= 40
expect path_0_26 <= 8
